<title>JAPAN: Fujitsu - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fujitsu - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.34 trln	 vs	    1.14 trln</p>
<p> Operating	   21.48		vs	   36.13</p>
<p> Current	     26.50		vs	   36.64</p>
<p> Net		   19.40		vs	   21.12</p>
<p> EPS		   10.54 yen	  vs	   11.60 yen</p>
<p> Shares	   1.84 billion	  vs	1.84 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fujitsu Ltd is a leading computer maker.</p>
</text>
